║ Network Layer:                 ║  ║ Prometheus (Metrics):          ║  ║ Day 0-7: Uncompressed          ║
║  • Rate Limiting               ║  ║  • Port 9090                   ║  ║  • Full resolution             ║
║    - API: 10 req/s             ║  ║  • Backend metrics             ║  ║  • Fast writes/queries         ║
║    - Data: 5 req/s             ║  ║  • AI Service metrics          ║  ║  • ~1.2GB per month            ║
║    - Static: 100 req/s         ║  ║  • TimescaleDB metrics         ║  ║                                ║
║  • Slowloris Protection        ║  ║  • Redis metrics               ║  ║ Day 7-60: Compressed           ║
║    - 12s body timeout          ║  ║                                ║  ║  • 4x reduction                ║
║    - 12s header timeout        ║  ║ Grafana (Dashboards):          ║  ║  • ~300MB per month            ║
║    - 1K buffer limits          ║  ║  • Port 3000                   ║  ║  • Acceptable query speed      ║
║                                ║  ║  • Real-time charts            ║  ║                                ║
