║  • Input Validation            ║  ║  • Custom dashboards           ║  ║  • Cron: Every 2 months        ║
║    - Device ID regex           ║  ║                                ║  ║  • Delete oldest 25%           ║
║    - Time range max 30d        ║  ║ Logs (Centralized):            ║  ║  • Keep ~45 days history       ║
║  • SQL Injection Prevention    ║  ║  • ELK Stack (optional)        ║  ║                                ║
║    - Parameterized queries     ║  ║  • Loki + Grafana              ║  ║ Redis Cache:                   ║
║  • CORS Restrictions           ║  ║  • CloudWatch (AWS)            ║  ║  • devices: 5s TTL             ║
║    - Origin patterns           ║  ║                                ║  ║  • hierarchical: 5s TTL        ║
║    - Specific headers          ║  ║ Health Checks:                 ║  ║  • history: 60s TTL            ║
║  • File Access Protection      ║  ║  • /health endpoints           ║  ║  • metadata: 5min TTL          ║
║    - Block .env, .git, .sql    ║  ║  • Kubernetes probes           ║  ║  • LRU eviction                ║
║                                ║  ║  • Service dependencies        ║  ║                                ║
