║ Nginx            │ 80            │ 80            │ HTTP     │ Reverse proxy (production)                                 ║
║ Nginx            │ 443           │ 443           │ HTTPS    │ Reverse proxy (SSL)                                        ║
║ Frontend         │ 5173          │ 3000          │ HTTP     │ React dev server (Vite)                                    ║
║ Backend          │ 8080          │ 18080         │ HTTP     │ Spring Boot REST API                                       ║
║ Backend MCP      │ 8000          │ 8000          │ HTTP     │ Model Context Protocol server                              ║
║ Backend gRPC     │ 9090          │ 9091          │ gRPC     │ gRPC endpoint (collector)                                  ║
║ AI Service       │ 3001          │ 3001          │ HTTP     │ FastAPI REST API                                           ║
║ AI Service WS    │ 3002          │ 3002          │ WS       │ WebSocket streaming                                        ║
║ Simulator        │ 8080          │ 5000          │ HTTP     │ PLC simulator API                                          ║
║ Collector        │ 9090          │ 9090          │ gRPC     │ gRPC data ingestion                                        ║
║ PostgreSQL       │ 5432          │ 15432         │ TCP      │ Relational database                                        ║
║ TimescaleDB      │ 5432          │ 15433         │ TCP      │ Time-series database                                       ║
║ Redis            │ 6379          │ 6379          │ TCP      │ Cache & sessions                                           ║
║ Ollama           │ 11434         │ 11434         │ HTTP     │ Local LLM API                                              ║
║ MQTT (internal)  │ 1883          │ -             │ MQTT     │ Internal broker                                            ║
║ MQTT (external)  │ 1883          │ 1884          │ MQTT     │ External broker (auth)                                     ║
║ Node-RED         │ 1880          │ 1880          │ HTTP     │ Flow editor & runtime                                      ║
║ Prometheus       │ 9090          │ 9090          │ HTTP     │ Metrics collection                                         ║
║ Grafana          │ 3000          │ 3000          │ HTTP     │ Metrics visualization                                      ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                         DATA FLOW SUMMARY                                                                  │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────┐
│ 1. INGESTION│  Simulator → MQTT → Node-RED → Collector → TimescaleDB (35 writes/sec)
└─────────────┘

┌─────────────┐
│ 2. RETRIEVAL│  Frontend → Nginx → Backend → Redis Cache? → TimescaleDB → JSON Response
└─────────────┘

┌─────────────┐
│ 3. AI QUERY │  User → Frontend → AI Service → Ollama/Claude → [TOOL: query] → MCP → TimescaleDB
└─────────────┘                                       ↓
                                           Data → Ollama/Claude → React Component → Frontend Render

┌─────────────┐
│ 4. CACHING  │  Request → @Cacheable → Redis? → (hit: return cached) OR (miss: query DB → cache → return)
└─────────────┘

┌─────────────┐
│ 5. CLEANUP  │  Cron (every 2 months) → TimescaleDB → DELETE oldest 25% → Free space
└─────────────┘

